1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,500
MARTA: You said you would call.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,200
I waited by the window.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,500
DANIEL: The line was dead all night.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
MARTA: That is what you always say.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
DANIEL: Because it is always true.
